# Profile: oauth-supabase
# The OAuth authorization server with Supabase as the consent-step identity provider.
# Everything up to the external identity provider is exercised; the project URL is a
# placeholder in an unroutable namespace and the scenarios stop at the sign-in page.
# The port is the gate's private API port (18199); the issuer URL must equal the URL the run targets
# (the scenarios assert it). If the gate uses another port, change this one line for the run.
NEURALSCAPE_PUBLIC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:18199
AUTH_PROVIDER=supabase
SUPABASE_URL=https://acceptance-placeholder.supabase.example
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<generate:hex32>
AUTH_ALLOWED_DOMAINS=acceptance-placeholder.example
